<p>You spin into a flying leap and deliver a powerful kick dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage to all enemies in a radius of 1 as you land. The range will increase by 1 per combo point and total damage will increase by 10% per combo point.</p><p>Using this talent removes your combo points and you must have at least 1 combo point to use it.</p>